abstract: >-
  CALION is an open-source Python framework for the joint investment
  planning and operational optimization of electrified industrial
  heating systems. Based on Mixed-Integer Linear Programming (MILP),
  it co-optimizes capacity sizing and hourly dispatch in a single
  problem formulation. CALION supports heat pumps with
  temperature-dependent COP, power-to-heat, CHP, thermal storage,
  and physical heat network modeling, with Perfect Foresight and
  Rolling Horizon workflows.
